  "prefLabel": "Med 413.01 Negotiating a Settlement Agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Med 413.01 Negotiating a Settlement Agreement. A licensee may engage in settlement negotiations with hearing counsel at any time until the board issues a final order in accordance with Med 208.01(a).\n\nSource. #9900, eff 4-12-11 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Med 400); ss by #12972, eff 1-10-20",
